      "text": [
        "Landscaping services built for Surrey gardens",
        "Whether you're starting with a bare plot or reworking a tired garden, we bring design, construction and planting together under one roof.",
        "Garden Design",
        "Bespoke design plans that make the most of your plot, your light and your lifestyle — from cottage gardens to contemporary courtyards.",
        "Patios & Paving",
        "Porcelain, natural stone and Indian sandstone patios laid to last, with drainage and levels done properly the first time.",
        "Lawns & Turfing",
        "New lawns laid from turf or seed, plus renovation of tired grass — levelled, drained and set up to thrive.",
        "Planting Schemes",
        "Year-round colour and structure using plants chosen for Surrey's soil and climate — and how much time you have to tend them.",
        "Decking & Outdoor Living",
        "Timber and composite decking, pergolas and outdoor kitchens designed to extend your living space outside.",
        "Garden Maintenance",
        "Ongoing care packages — mowing, pruning, hedge cutting and seasonal tidy-ups — to keep your garden looking its best.",
        "What We Do"
      ]
